        "text": "Step 4: Calculate vector \\( \\overrightarrow{AC} \\):\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{AC} = C - A = (4 - 0, 5 - (-1), 1 - (-1)) = (4, 6, 2)\n\\]"
      },
      {
